| info = 
*{{WF|Cyte-09}} expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''25''' energy to plant an antenna that scans enemies within {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''45 / 50 / 55 / 60''' meters at a <u>'''75'''</u> degree frontal angle, lasting for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''20 / 25 / 30 / 35''' seconds. The antenna is an [[Invulnerable]] intangible stationary object that pulses a scanner wave every <u>'''3'''</u> seconds. When washed over by the wave, enemies are detected for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''5''' seconds, having their silhouette and [[Enemy Body Parts|weak spots]] highlighted through walls and receive {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''30% / 45% / 60% / 75%''' increased damage to weak spots. While an antenna is active, Cyte-09's primary and secondary [[Weapons]] gain {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''10''' meter [[Punch Through]] against enemy bodies and <u>'''infinite'''</u> punch through against terrain. A maximum of <u>'''3'''</u> antennas can be planted.
**When casting the ability, Cyte-09 rises into the air then drops to the ground to slam the antenna in front of him. The antenna can be placed on solid surfaces and in mid-air.
**Enemies scanned by Seek are marked on the minimap for all players.
**Detected enemies are only highlighted through walls for the user and allied Cyte-09 Warframes.
**Punch through applies to melees, allowing them to hit through walls.
** The weak point damage bonus stacks additively to weak point multiplier formula in [[Acuity Mods]]. For example, a weapon with max rank {{M|Primary Acuity}} and a '''75%''' bonus from Seek will do {{Math|(2 + 3.5 + 0.75) x 1.5|t=y|bf-a=y}}x damage to a {{E|Lancer|Lancer's}} weak spot. With a {{Arcane|Primary Deadhead}} (or {{Arcane|Secondary Deadhead}}) equipped, it becomes {{Math|[(2 + 3.5 + 0.75) x 1.5] x (1 + 0.3)|t=y|bf-a=y}}x damage to a {{E|Lancer|Lancer's}} weak spot.
*When Cyte-09 has undergone [[Polarization]] via [[Forma]], his primary energy color highlights the weak spots, while his secondary energy color highlights the enemy's silhouette.
| interactions =
* Seek highlights weak points for Cyte-09's <u>'''1%'''</u> [[Critical Chance]] from weak point kills [[Cyte-09/Abilities|passive]], {{A|Evade}}'s duration extension and health restore, and {{A|Neutralize}}'s ricochet.
| augment = 
| tips = 
*When modded for high range, it helps quickly find and kill [[Demolisher]]s. (except for [[#Bugs|enemy necramechs]])
| max = 
| bugs =
*{{E|Arbitration Shield Drone}}s will '''not''' dispel the marking.
*{{D|Ragdoll}}ed enemies will immediately lose all marking.
*The ability does '''not''' highlight weak spots if the enemy lacks a conventional "head". {{E|Deimos Saxum}}, {{E|Aurax Atloc Raknoid}}, {{E|Demolisher Juggernaut}}, etc. will '''not''' be detected, and will '''not''' take more damage.
**{{E|Tusk Seeker Drone}} has a head (according to {{Weapon|Vesper 77}} and [[Incarnon]] charging) but Seek does '''not''' highlight it. This does not seem to be a problem of non-humanoid shapes, as the ability '''does''' affect {{E|Rogue Culverin}}, {{E|Techrot Babau}}, and {{E|Deimos Jugulus}}.
**The ability can still highlight the silhouette of such enemies, but [[Necramech_(Enemy)|enemy necramechs]] (e.g {{E|Rogue Voidrig}}, {{E|Demolisher Bonewidow}}, etc.) will '''not''' be highlighted at all.
}}
